    "en": {
      "title": "Slope stabilisation",
      "h1": "MR / Pneumatic and hydraulic machines",
      "description": "Marini’s MR series is a collection of compact rigs specially designed for foundation work and slope stabilisation. The series is developed to meet challenging…",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "Marini logo",
          "href": "/produkter/marini",
          "width": 637,
          "height": 86,
          "src": "/assets/img/logo-marini.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "alt": "MR / Pneumatic and hydraulic machines, image 2",
          "width": 1125,
          "height": 767,
          "src": "/assets/img/marini-slantstabilisering-2-2.webp"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Marini’s <strong>MR</strong> series is a collection of compact rigs specially designed for foundation work and slope stabilisation. The series is developed to meet challenging conditions and deliver high performance in complex environments."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Most of the models below can be both hydraulic and pneumatic. The pneumatic models are generally lighter. Many of these rigs can also be dismantled into smaller parts for transport."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Each model offers different stroke lengths, feed forces, pull-back force and rotation torque depending on specific requirements."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "See the table a little further down for the technical specifications."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "<a href=\"/kontakta-oss\">Contact us</a> for more information."
        },
